  "description": "Hayaati is a bold and energetic fragrance that blends fresh fruits, warm spices, and smooth woody amber accords into a modern masculine scent. The fragrance feels youthful, versatile, and slightly sweet while maintaining a strong fresh-spicy character throughout the wear. The opening introduces apple and bergamot, creating a crisp fruity freshness with a bright uplifting character. The heart develops into cinnamon and woody notes, adding warmth, spice, and smooth masculine depth to the composition. The base settles into musk and vanilla, leaving a warm, creamy, and long-lasting trail that feels clean, modern, and addictive. Hayaati is perfect for men who enjoy fresh spicy fragrances with fruity sweetness and smooth woody warmth.",
